WEBVTT

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.020
<v You>I think I need to turn this project down.</v>

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.140
<v COMPASS>What makes it a no?</v>

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:20.560
<v You>The deadline…</v>

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.320
<v You>Actually, no.</v>

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.320
<v You>It's doing the work before I get paid.</v>

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.840
<v COMPASS>Then would an upfront payment change your decision?</v>

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:34.960
<v You>Yes.</v>

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:36.800
<v You>Help me ask for that.</v>
